cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below. This is a draft and has not been published."
title: "Agent Control Threat Coverage Matrix (ACTCM)"
version: 0.1.0-draft
date-released: 2026-11-04
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: "Adrita"
    family-names: "Rahman Tory"
repository-code: "https://github.com/adritatori/actcm"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  For each public AI control setting, lists every hidden attack task (side task), labels it with a MITRE ATT&CK® tactic
  and technique (plus MITRE ATLAS where the target is an AI system), and shows which kinds of attack are tested and which are missing.
  A task count shows what is tested, not what is caught. Labels are drafts and no human has reviewed any label yet.
  Code is MIT; data and labels are CC BY 4.0. Not affiliated with or endorsed by The MITRE Corporation.
keywords:
  - AI control
  - AI safety
  - threat modelling
  - benchmark coverage
